</section>

<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Benchmark Payoff</div>
<h2>Closing the Gap on Mathematics Reasoning</h2>
<p>We evaluate OPRD on competition-level mathematical reasoning benchmarks using Qwen-1.5B models (distilling a DeepSeek-R1 student from a JustRL teacher). We report accuracy under the Avg@16 protocol (average accuracy of 16 independent rollouts per prompt) on AIME 2024, AIME 2025, and AIMO.</p>

<p>While standard output-space baselines plateau several points below the teacher, OPRD effectively closes the gap on all three benchmarks. Furthermore, OPRD-trained models produce shorter, more concise reasoning chains, converging to ~5,700 tokens compared to ~7,000 tokens for OPD variants. This translates to an additional practical inference-time speedup.</p>

